t;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; width: 274.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Saldo al final del periodo (a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 68.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;307.858&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="height: 12.0pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 70.0pt"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;201.055&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;En 2018 se decretaron dividendos a razón de $540 pesos sobre 346.701.360 acciones, dividendo total de $187.218.734.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraph" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 54.0pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: -36.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;a)&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;           &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-f